From a1e342f520059991d0ab5b67743c079864b23f83 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 13:55:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] build(dev): pin ruff to the 0.17 series

requirements-dev.txt installed whatever ruff is newest. Ruff changes its
formatter style and its rule set between minor releases, so the same
commit could pass today and fail after the next release, and a format
check would start failing on unchanged code. Pin the 0.17 series, the
one the repository is about to be formatted with, and say how to
upgrade.
---
 requirements-dev.txt | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/requirements-dev.txt b/requirements-dev.txt
index 6fab0e4..5535e09 100644
--- a/requirements-dev.txt
+++ b/requirements-dev.txt
@@ -5,7 +5,9 @@ setuptools>=68
 wheel
 pytest>=7
 pytest-cov
-ruff
+# ruff 的格式风格与规则集随 minor 版本变化，限定在一个系列；升级时以 make fmt 重新格式化
+# 全仓库，与版本号一起提交。
+ruff>=0.17,<0.18
 pydantic>=2,<3
 cryptography>=42
 jsonschema
-- 
2.43.0

